{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-1","name":"プロデューサー","text":"結華、水","trans":"结华，水","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6007004030010","name":"結華","text":"！\r\nありがとう","trans":"！\n谢谢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ラストスパートだな","trans":"到最后冲刺了啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6007004030020","name":"結華","text":"……んっ……んっ……──\r\nえへへ、うん","trans":"……咕……咕……──\n嘿嘿，嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6007004030030","name":"結華","text":"まだまだ楽しませてみせるから、安心して見ててよ","trans":"我还会继续让大家开心的，放心看着吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6007004030040","name":"結華","text":"お水、ありがとう","trans":"谢谢你给我水","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6007004030050","name":"結華","text":"──よ～し！\r\nまだまだ、ここから……！","trans":"──好～！\n接下来，才刚开始……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6007004030060","name":"結華","text":"頑張ってくぞ～！","trans":"我要继续加油了～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──……頑張れ、結華","trans":"──……加油，结华","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}